DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261117T180000
SUMMARY:Satellite Event: From Smart AI to Better Work
LOCATION:Beethovenstrasse 48\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:An interactive executive lab run with Zeix on redesigning work 
 around AI: deciding what the machine should actually do\, and marking out 
 where human judgement\, responsibility and control have to stay.\n\nOrgani
 ser: Swiss AI Summit / Zeix\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdata
 events.ch/events/swiss-ai-summit-satellite-better-work-2026/
