DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261123
SUMMARY:STEM4Health Hackathon
LOCATION:ETH Zürich Campus Hönggerberg\, HPH building\, Zurich
DESCRIPTION:A hundred students and early-career researchers spend a weekend
  on real pharmaceutical manufacturing problems\, combining manufacturing d
 ata\, mechanistic modelling and machine learning with industry and academi
 c mentors before pitching to a jury.\n\nOrganiser: Johnson & Johnson Switz
 erland / Swiss Data Science Center\n\nDetails and registration: https://sw
 issdataevents.ch/events/stem4health-hackathon-zurich-2026/
