SUMMARY:Software Engineering in der Vibe-Code-Ära
LOCATION:OST – Ostschweizer Fachhochschule\, Campus Rapperswil\, Raum 1.2
 13\, Rapperswil-Jona
DESCRIPTION:One-day German-language course for senior engineers\, tech lead
 s and CTOs who already code with agentic tools: build your own eval suite\
 , an MCP tool wired to your build and test commands\, a CI hook that block
 s bad AI patches\, and a cost-per-feature model comparison — working on 
 your own repository. Limited to 16 participants.\n\nOrganiser: OST – Ost
 schweizer Fachhochschule (Institut für Computational Engineering)\n\nDeta
 ils and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ost-software-engin
 eering-vibe-code-aera-rapperswil-2027/
