SUMMARY:AI for Decision Makers — Executive Course at ETH Zurich
LOCATION:Swiss AI Tower (Andreasturm)\, Andreasstrasse 5\, Oerlikon\, Zuric
 h
DESCRIPTION:A five-day English-language executive course for leaders who ne
 ed to challenge assumptions on AI projects without becoming data scientist
 s — data science foundations\, MLOps\, AI governance and ethics\, genera
 tive AI and a first agent\, with an ETH Zurich certificate. Registration c
 loses 15 January 2027.\n\nRuns until 5 Feb — see the event page for sess
 ion dates.\n\nOrganiser: Swiss Data Science Center / ETH Zürich School fo
 r Continuing Education\n\nDetails and registration: https://swissdataevent
 s.ch/events/sdsc-ai-for-decision-makers-eth-2027/
